1
00:00:00,218 --> 00:00:01,648
(Penny:)Oh, which one?

2
00:00:01,653 --> 00:00:02,883
(Penny:)Maybe we can get Amy to try it.

3
00:00:02,888 --> 00:00:04,888
(Bernadette:)I don't know.

4
00:00:04,890 --> 00:00:06,460
(Bernadette:)Stuart, can you come in here?

5
00:00:06,458 --> 00:00:08,158
(Bernadette:)He tried to explain it to me.

6
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,890
(Bernadette:)It shows you pictures
of people nearby,

7
00:00:09,895 --> 00:00:13,295
(Bernadette:)you swipe them around,
it looks kind of like a game.

8
00:00:13,298 --> 00:00:16,898
(Penny:)Oh, and if you lose the game,
you have to go out with Stuart.

9
00:00:19,271 --> 00:00:20,271
(Stuart:)What's up?

10
00:00:20,272 --> 00:00:22,502
(Bernadette:)Can you show us that dating app?

11
00:00:22,507 --> 00:00:24,137
(Stuart:)Oh, yeah, sure.

12
00:00:24,142 --> 00:00:26,972
(Stuart:)This thing has changed my life.

13
00:00:26,978 --> 00:00:28,408
(Penny:)Wow. So how many
girls have you met?

14
00:00:28,413 --> 00:00:30,083
(Stuart:)Two.

15
00:00:31,016 --> 00:00:32,186
(Stuart:)I probably don't need to mention

16
00:00:32,184 --> 00:00:35,284
(Stuart:)there's an entire number
between that and zero.

17
00:00:35,287 --> 00:00:36,917
(Penny:)Well, so how
does it work?

18
00:00:36,922 --> 00:00:39,352
Uh, well, it-it shows me all

19
00:00:39,357 --> 00:00:41,657
(Stuart:)the single women
in a five-mile radius

20
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:43,090
(Stuart:)who are using the app.

21
00:00:43,094 --> 00:00:45,524
(Stuart:)If I like the way they look,
I hit “thumbs up.”

22
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:47,430
If I don't, “thumbs down.”

23
00:00:47,432 --> 00:00:49,332
(Bernadette:)Oh, what would make you
give a girl a thumbs down?

24
00:00:49,334 --> 00:00:53,834
(Stuart:)First time it happens
I will let you know.

25
00:00:55,006 --> 00:00:58,676
(Leonard:)Oh, hey. I just heard back
from the liquid helium guy.

26
00:00:58,677 --> 00:01:00,477
(Sheldon:)What's he say?

